WEBVTT

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.330
This is AKB0048's...

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.120
...exclusive concert hall!

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:19.830
Yeah!

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.540
00 Stage.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.000
Wow. There are so many people!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.710
A-Are they all fans?

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.380
Of course!

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.590
So this is where we'll sing and dance.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.930
Oh gosh! My stomach's fluttering.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:40.680
I'm gonna have a heart attack...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.640
The show's about to start.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:51.530
Hello, everyone!

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:54.740
We'll be opening for today's performance!

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.410
We're the 75th generation understudies!

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:00.450
The 75th generation understudies?

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.160
Just the two of them?

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.080
Listen to our song!

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.620
"The Lemon Season".

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:17.050
The 75th generation is known as the "Cursed Generation".

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.510
The "Cursed Generation"?

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.230
So many failed or quit.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.690
Only those two remain.

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:43.100
As you ran across campus in your uniform,

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:44.370
Neither has been able to become a successor.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:49.570
I watched longingly, hidden in the curtains.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.080
It's been two years.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.290
Two whole years?!

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.330
But...

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:53.610
A single unripe lemon.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.670
they're performing so well...

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.970
And yet...

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.430
Is it just me, or is the crowd not feeling it?

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.350
I see what you mean...

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:13.090
A fruit that's still too young,

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:16.240
Go, go, Kanata!

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:20.030
Kanata!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.030
Kanata!

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:26.410
Thank you all!

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:31.000
AKB0048!

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:50.480
One, two, three, four!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.120
Listen to the music pounding in your head...

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.130
<i>Our scattering sweat shall turn into song.</i>

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.210
<i>Our flowing tears shall turn into stars.</i>

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:32.100
Even if you reach out your hand,

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:38.690
you won't be able to reach it yet.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:44.280
Our dreams still lie

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:49.870
much, much further in the distance.

