00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.750
Even the stars of the sky

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:57.000
lie billions of lightyears away,

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:02.880
shining beyond the shadows.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:09.140
Let me speak of hope,

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:15.230
like a nameless poet: with passion.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:21.280
If you find yourself broken down in tears,

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:26.740
then rather than consoling you,

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:33.410
let me speak of the coming dawn.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:45.890
- I Won't Let Down Their Efforts-

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.010
That was amazing!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:42.970
Yeah!

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.300
I think Takamina looked right at me!

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:46.050
You're kidding!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:46.840
For real?

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.220
For real!

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:50.220
On stage today were...

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.350
S-Someday, I'll be on that stage...

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.520
Maybe in a million years!

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:57.190
Here's the backstage entrance.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.530
Sis-sis!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.280
Ow... Sonata?!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.280
Sis-sis! Sis-sis! Sis-sis!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.290
You were great out there!

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.290
Is that Sonata's older sister?

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.210
Sis-sis! Sis-sis...

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.210
Oh my. Is that Kanata's little sister?

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.170
You were super awesome on stage!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.250
Sonata...

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.960
Sis-sis...

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.300
Get off!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.050
Tsubasa-san! What in the world is Sonata doing here?

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.350
What do you mean?

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.470
She doesn't meet the minimum age requirement!

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.100
She should have been barred from the auditions!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.100
Perhaps.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.940
Nonetheless, she came to attend the auditions.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.060
I accepted her determination.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.150
How could—

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:44.740
She's right! Sonata's totally determined!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:45.570
I wanna join you and—

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:46.110
Go home.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.610
Go home, now!

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.450
You're not supposed to be here!

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.040
You have no right to tell her that.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.960
Only Sonata can decide what to do with her own life.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.840
Though your generations are different, you are all equally understudies.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.840
You will practice together from now on.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:09.590
Meet Shinonome Kanata and Kishida Mimori.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.760
Hello! I'm Mimori.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.100
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.890
Oh, please excuse me.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.690
It's very nice to meet you!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.150
Please, just relax!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.150
I hope we get along.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.660
Here we have the 00 dormitory where we reside.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.410
And this is the dining hall.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.370
Chef Papa's cooking is exquisite.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.000
Are these the new girls?

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.460
I'm going to prepare a special dinner to welcome you.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.670
Save your appetites!

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:49.380
We have plenty of practice rooms, too.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:51.840
You can wash away your sweat in the bath.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:54.510
You can have a chat over a light snack.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.060
Please, enjoy yourselves!

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.980
This place is so beautiful!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:00.020
It's a far cry from the Katyusha!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.150
Just look at it sparkle!

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.520
I can smell the <i>eau de idol!</i>

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:06.480
<i>Eau de</i> what?

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.990
You've never heard of it?

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.150
The scent that lingers where cute girls gather...

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.450
Its sweet smell is irresistible!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.370
Such peculiar tastes.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.370
Let's see...

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.500
Makoto, Yuuka, and Orine.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:22.960
And also Sonata.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.710
You'll be dorming in here.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.260
This room is adorable!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.180
It's lovely!

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.760
Your lessons start tomorrow.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:36.350
Once you finish dinner, get an early night.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:37.810
Okay!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.480
Hey, Sis-sis?

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:44.110
You know, Sonata just wanted to be with...

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:55.530
Chieri-san, Nagisa-san, and Suzuko-san, you'll be living here.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.490
Okay.

00:07:56.490 --> 00:08:00.290
Your bags have been brought up, so make sure everything's there.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.540
<i>A new room.</i>

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.250
<i>A new me.</i>

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.960
<i>Everything starts here!</i>

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:31.320
Well, do your best, girls!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:33.990
It's time to hustle!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.870
Okay! Hustle!

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:37.160
Hustle?

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:37.950
Hustle...

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.450
What's your room like?

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.080
Simple, but cute.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.960
I wonder if every room is different.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.540
Show us your place later.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.250
Sure! Come right over.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.470
Suzuko-san! What are you doing?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:54.380
Call me Linda.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.550
Huh?

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.890
L-Linda... what are you doing?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:00.510
Looking at these.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.640
Portraits of past members?

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:07.650
They're past Center Novae.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.190
Center Novae?

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:10.070
What are those?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:16.030
AKB0048 currently has a different center for each song.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:21.040
But in the past, there was a single
center known as the "Center Nova".

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:26.540
The last to hold that position was Acchan the 13th.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:32.170
However, after she graduated,
the position was done away with.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:35.590
I remember! Acchan the 13th!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.390
She was at the concert we saw when we were young.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.890
She was incredible.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:43.600
Before Acchan the 13th was Mii-chan the 5th.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.560
Before her, Yuihan the 6th.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:52.150
And before her, Yuuko the 7th. All were Center Novae.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.990
Wow. There's such a long history.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:59.370
But why did they get rid of the Center Nova?

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:01.780
That's what I wanna know.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.870
Yuuko-san!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:05.750
Yo!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:11.420
Just wait. I'll bring back the title of Center Nova myself!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:15.260
I won't be satisfied with where I stand now!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.380
You gotta keep striving to reach the next level!

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.560
All right! Let's do this!

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.690
We may be understudies now, but there's still the next level.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:33.230
Once we're successors, there's still the next level!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:38.610
The next levels never end! It's so exciting, right?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:39.660
Right?

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:40.160
Yeah.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.070
Definitely.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.580
No way! No way! No way!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.580
I am <i>not</i> going home!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.080
Don't be so immature!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.000
Stop, Kanata.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.330
I can't believe you lied to get into 00.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.170
Well, you're a liar, too!

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:57.670
You've joined 0048, but you're still not a successor.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.550
You're a liar!

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:03.640
You're an uglyface!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.270
Kanata...

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.320
I'm exhausted...

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.950
You haven't seen your sister in years.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.830
Aren't you being a bit insensitive?

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.080
She doesn't know a thing.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.500
How hard the practice is.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.880
How little you're rewarded for your pain.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.130
I don't want her to feel as frustrated and pathetic

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.590
as I do right now.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.510
Oh, don't be a worrywart.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:45.970
Just think!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.930
We're 75th generation—the Cursed Generation.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:56.940
Maybe your sister will shoot right up the ranks to successor.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.780
How can you just shrug it off like that?

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.200
It's been two years already!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.490
Everyone else from our generation quit.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:06.780
We've practiced with all we've got.

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:10.410
We've even studied the original members.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:15.000
But none of that made us successors.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.540
Whether you become a successor—

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.130
Depends on the essence of your soul, right?

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.010
I get it.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:25.140
Neither personality nor skill will earn me the name of an original member.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:28.600
But I'll never have my revenge on them at this rate!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:37.270
Our father was the leader of a pro-entertainment coalition.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:43.400
I always sang, so I could see my father smile.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:48.240
But in a battle with DES forces, he...

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:59.250
I joined 00 so I could fight DES.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.710
So that's why...

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:07.180
That's why I don't want Sonata to walk the same path as me...

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.890
to face this pain and danger.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.060
But don't you like to sing?

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.650
Have you even been listening?

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.860
I couldn't care less about singing!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.110
But I do.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.280
I like your singing.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.700
It doesn't matter if anyone <i>likes</i> it!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.610
I need to avenge my father.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:34.330
That's why I'm going to become a successor,
perform on the front lines, and fight against DES.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.750
Kanata...

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:44.510
Time to get up, Nagisa.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.430
Nagisa.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.090
I'm still sleepy...

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:51.510
I'll bet you were up late watching 00 music videos again.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.220
Daddy's going to scold you.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.230
00...

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.540
You're up?

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:16.000
Did you have any dreams?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:21.960
Kirara...

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.590
Morning, Chieri.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:29.470
Morning...

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:48.030
Finally! Dance lessons!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:51.160
Say goodbye to the toils of combat training!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.320
I can hardly wait!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:56.910
You said it. Bruise-inducing lessons are <i>not</i> idol lessons.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.000
Hear, hear!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.040
Time to dance our hearts out!

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.190
You there! Move with the rhythm!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.060
I'm standing there

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.310
Okay!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:25.940
on the stage of my dreams,

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.940
That's enough.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:26.820
amidst the...

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.610
I'm dying. I'm really dying.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.530
This is no better than combat training.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.370
In fact, it's worse.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:36.700
Did you say something?

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:37.240
No!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.450
N-Nothing at all!

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:40.080
You, the little one.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:42.370
Have you memorized the song?

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:43.420
Don't call me little!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.920
That's why I warned her...

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.010
I swear, you girls...

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:53.180
...to glow so much brighter than me.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:56.430
Our sweat carries our dreams,

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:00.020
which bloom slowly like a...

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.440
No, no, no, no!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.730
You're all over the place!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.270
Especially you...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:09.820
Kanata!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:13.700
There's not a spark of life in your dancing today!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:14.240
But—

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:17.830
These girls from the 77th generation have just begun their training.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.160
They're still wellsprings of potential.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:24.790
You've had two years of lessons, but just look at you.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.090
Seriously?

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:27.840
That's way harsh...

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.260
What was your name again?

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.010
Chieri?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.300
Yes!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.550
You come up front.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.220
Switch places with Kanata.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.430
Hang on!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:39.310
Why is the new girl upstaging me?

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.970
I'm just trying to keep it balanced.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:45.060
Besides, if you have no motivation, you have no right to speak.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.360
I couldn't do that.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.950
I haven't mastered the choreography yet.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:55.820
Please let me stay here to
observe the older members.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:03.040
I only joined recently. There's still a lot I don't understand.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:06.000
I'm counting on the more experienced girls to set a good example.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:09.550
Kanata?

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:10.880
Kanata, wait up!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.420
H-Hey now.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.590
You went too far! Way too far!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:16.510
My Sis-sis is amazing!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.100
She's the best at everything!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:22.020
At singing, and dancing...

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:23.850
So how come...

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.850
Your nickname is now officially Meanyface!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:28.810
Sonata...

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:33.150
Meanyface! Meanyface! Meanyface!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.320
I suppose this is enough.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.110
Seeing as those two have run off,

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.740
let's end the lessons here.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.780
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.240
Meanyface! Meanyface!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.780
Meanyface! Meanyface! Meanyface!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.700
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.450
I sense we may have found a catalyst.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.080
Meanyface! Meanyface! Meanyface!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.960
Perhaps.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.960
Meanyface!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.380
I think what you did was wrong.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:54.510
Kanata-san's been working super hard!

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:55.260
But you...

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:55.920
I know.

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.680
I can tell just by looking at her.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:01.850
Her dancing and singing is probably on par with the successors.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.560
Better, even.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:08.150
It takes a lot of effort to get that good.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:08.900
Chieri.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:13.360
But there are some things you can only be born with.

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.780
There's a radiance that no
amount of effort will earn you.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.280
The radiance of an idol.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.160
Nagisa?

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.830
We're going to look for Kanata-san—

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.750
You! What did you do to Nagisa?

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.960
Sh-She didn't do anything.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:34.500
Let's go.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.690
<i>What's the big deal?</i>

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:52.270
<i>The singing and dancing...</i>

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:56.030
<i>All I care about is avenging my father.</i>

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:00.570
AKB0048 loves it!

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:03.240
New feeling! New flavor!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:02.990
<i>So why...</i>

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.750
<i>Why does it frustrate me so much?</i>

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:14.250
<i>Some days, I just can't dance,</i>

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:19.760
<i>so I go home crying.</i>

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:25.010
<i>Some days, I just can't sing,</i>

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:31.020
<i>so I lose faith in myself.</i>

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:40.200
<i>My rivals always seem to glow so much brighter than me.</i>

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:44.280
<i>Our sweat carries our dreams,</i>

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.320
Mimori.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:48.870
<i>which bloom slowly like a flower.</i>

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:55.790
<i>I swear that I won't let down their efforts.</i>

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.630
Stop it!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:59.840
<i>Our sweat carries our dreams,</i>

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.300
If you keep singing...

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:04.010
<i>which lie budding, in wait,</i>

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.720
Stop!

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:10.350
<i>until the day our wishes blossom.</i>

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.020
You'll make me start liking it.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:16.730
You'll make me start to like singing!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:21.820
Isn't that a good thing?

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.660
You're free to like it.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.740
The more you like...

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.910
The more you love, the better!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:34.920
After all, AKB0048 are the idols who come to see you.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:38.590
They're the idols who sing their love.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:41.050
Mimori...

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:46.300
<i>Some days I give up</i>

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.890
<i>on balancing school and lessons.</i>

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:54.060
<i>But then I hear an encore</i>

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:57.690
<i>sounding in the distance.</i>

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:01.150
<i>Our dreams lie beyond our tears.</i>

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:04.910
<i>They're the smiles that flower after we've cried.</i>

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:10.540
<i>They're the buds that worked so hard to bloom.</i>

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.450
<i>Our dreams...</i>

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.450
Kanata!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:16.880
Kanata! Kanata!

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:18.380
Sonata.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:26.800
Kanata! Kanata! Kanata!

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:19.920
That's impressive.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:25.180
You're not a successor yet, but
you've already got a diehard fan.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.310
Go on, Kanata.

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.260
Okay.

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:33.140
Come on, Sonata!

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.100
The rest of you, too!

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.060
Okay!

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:39.520
Yeah!

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:43.110
Our sweat carries our dreams,

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:46.990
which bloom slowly like a flower.

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:48.870
I swear that I won't

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:52.160
let down their efforts.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.120
Our sweat carries our dreams,

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:59.790
which lie budding, in wait,

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:01.540
until the day

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:07.010
our wishes blossom.

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:23.780
The stars that shine in the night sky

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:26.360
lie billions of lightyears away.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.910
Even if the depths of despair

00:22:28.910 --> 00:22:31.450
should cast an endless shadow,

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:34.040
the truth will make itself heard.

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:36.700
Who shall be the one to receive

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:36.700
jikan no kawa ni takushita

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:39.080
the message of light

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:39.080
sono hikari no messeeji

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:41.460
set adrift on the river of time?

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:41.460
uketoru mono wa dare dai?

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:46.590
People are born, and people die.

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:44.420
hito wa umarete hito wa shinde yuku

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:46.590
hito wa umarete hito wa shinde yuku

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:51.050
Our bodies don't last forever.

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:47.050
nikutai wa horobiru yo

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:51.050
nikutai wa horobiru yo

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:56.720
Those who rise back up from the ashes

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:56.720
hai no naka kara yomigaeru mono wa

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:02.440
give passion to the next generation.

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:02.440
jounetsu tsugi no sedai e

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:05.820
Dreams are like reincarnation.

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:05.820
yume wa reincarnation

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:10.740
Like déjà vu, my distant memories

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:10.740
nando demo deja vu no you na

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:12.410
keep coming back to me.

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:12.410
tooi kioku

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:16.620
It's just like reincarnation.

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:16.620
marude reincarnation

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:21.000
With my head still in the clouds,

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:21.000
ima mo mata muishiki no uchi

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:25.170
I'm running off somewhere again.

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:25.170
dokoka e hashitteru

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:32.180
Will enough tears make me give up?

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:32.180
ikutsume no namida de akirameru no ka?

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:38.220
Will enough lives make my dream come true?

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:38.220
ikutsume no inochi de kanau mono nano ka?

00:23:46.110 --> 00:23:48.570
Are you free after this?

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:50.560
"Operation Luscious Pheromones"!

00:23:50.560 --> 00:23:52.280
Are you going to follow me all day?

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:54.310
Chieri! Watch out!

00:23:54.310 --> 00:23:59.600
The ability to make the most of your days off will greatly impact your futures.

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:00.080
- Their Day Off-
